# Combustion Technique's only target becoming illegal (CR 608.2b): with the spell on the stack aimed at Bot2's Llanowar Elves, Bot2
# casts its Octopus Form on the Elves, which gain hexproof (and +1/+1). The Elves are no longer a legal target of Bot1's spell, so
# it does not resolve: no damage, and the exile replacement is not made either - the Elves are a 2/2 with no damage, still on the
# battlefield, and nothing is in exile. Combustion Technique goes to Bot1's graveyard, countered on resolution.

